<title>USA: Cleveland Cavs' Anderson gets Nike deal.</title>
<headline>Cleveland Cavs' Anderson gets Nike deal.</headline>
<dateline>WEST ORANGE, N.J. 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Derek Anderson, an NBA rookie from the University of Kentucky, has signed a multi-million, multi-year endorsement deal with Nike Inc, his agent, Worldwide Entertainment &amp; Sports Corp said Friday.</p>
<p>The specific terms of the deal were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Shooting guard Anderson was the Cleveland Cavaliers' first round selection in this year's National Basketball Association draft.</p>
<p>Anderson will promote Nike's &quot;Brand Jordan&quot; shoes, Worldwide Entertainment said.</p>
</text>
